WEBVTT

00:00:03.045 --> 00:00:05.827
Two panels — source and destination at once

00:00:05.877 --> 00:00:12.177
Arrows move the cursor; Enter opens, Backspace comes back to it

00:00:14.208 --> 00:00:18.408
⌃4 — a detailed view with size, date and permissions

00:00:18.902 --> 00:00:23.802
⌘F jumps to a name as you type it

00:00:24.389 --> 00:00:29.989
F3 opens a file in place — text, hex or image

00:00:34.241 --> 00:00:37.741
Space selects — the footer counts what you picked

00:00:39.204 --> 00:00:45.504
F5 copies — asynchronous, cancellable, with real progress

00:00:47.552 --> 00:00:54.552
⌘T runs commands where the panel is pointing

00:00:55.790 --> 00:01:01.390
Changes made outside the app appear on their own

00:01:01.465 --> 00:01:07.765
F2 — themes and settings, applied live

00:01:10.615 --> 00:01:15.515
F1 lists every binding, generated from the live keymap
